@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5379

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Scalar's password-grant adapter (use a development account)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username={{username}}&password={{password}}

### Refresh and rotate tokens (use the latest refresh_token from the response)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### Unsupported grants return an OAuth error
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials

### Delete an allocation and return balanced transaction detail (Editor or Owner)
# Set tenantKey, transactionKey, splitKey, and accessToken to values from your local session.
# Use a transaction with at least two splits. The response is 200 with TransactionDetailDto.
DELETE {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/{{tenantKey}}/transactions/{{transactionKey}}/splits/{{splitKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Deleting the final allocation returns 400 validation ProblemDetails
# After reducing a transaction to one split, use that surviving allocation's key.
DELETE {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/{{tenantKey}}/transactions/{{transactionKey}}/splits/{{remainingSplitKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing allocation returns 404 ProblemDetails
DELETE {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/{{tenantKey}}/transactions/{{transactionKey}}/splits/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json